    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 9,
        "sourceEnd": 158,
        "text": "Good morning, everyone. Today we're going to talk about school uniforms. Before we start, let me ask you: do you think students should wear uniforms?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0476e5255ec99de3e7ace66739adba0f494c28a07fc6b8f4506d3d933a3e3102",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 160,
        "sourceEnd": 286,
        "text": "Student A (Li): I think uniforms are a good idea because they save time in the morning. You don't have to decide what to wear.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9dd479ba4444849866db6723b7e679187eda35e9e94280621fadd480c64cfb2a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 287,
        "sourceEnd": 391,
        "text": "Student B (Wang): But uniforms are boring. We all look the same. I think we should wear our own clothes.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "00e2a05bc843bbef84f205c52f057cfc60f06902e2983058b90d3681abe1e292",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 401,
        "sourceEnd": 780,
        "text": "Interesting. Li said uniforms save time. Wang said they are boring. Now, let's think about the arguments. A good paragraph usually has a topic sentence and supporting sentences. For example, 'School uniforms are beneficial for several reasons.' That's a topic sentence. Then you give reasons: they save time, they reduce bullying about clothes, and they are cheaper for families.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f622c78cc4e8d595406335740f2bdea7894ebe35ebcd1f03d7f388703f8c834c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "student a",
        "speaker": "Student A",
        "sourceStart": 792,
        "sourceEnd": 871,
        "text": "But what about students who can't afford uniforms? Some uniforms are expensive.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cd4c899e24822d76514bf3bb581fbbcb5891dfbebdbbed390aba985f4e7aa25e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 881,
        "sourceEnd": 1176,
        "text": "That's a good point. Although uniforms can be expensive, many schools offer help. While some students dislike uniforms, others find them comfortable. Because uniforms are simple, students don't worry about fashion. Because of the cost, some families struggle. So, we need to consider both sides.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7653b817ee71f713f79e2314c275628251099aad3129deeb0843edafcf5136ff",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student b",
        "speaker": "Student B",
        "sourceStart": 1188,
        "sourceEnd": 1295,
        "text": "I see. So a good paragraph should have a clear topic sentence and then support it with examples or reasons.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c34fe4c0ebce246925be0c4f7d501d4f50e9549b4922d3e7848fbfe1ac24d7f0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 1305,
        "sourceEnd": 1634,
        "text": "Exactly. And remember, you can use 'although' and 'while' to show contrast, and 'because' and 'because of' to show reason. 'Because' is followed by a clause, and 'because of' is followed by a noun or noun phrase. For example, 'Because uniforms are cheap, families save money.' and 'Because of the low price, families save money.'",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c6ce29fcb34318b5a1e87cf3388a41b767a05f5f319d5aa5e1ffccc1e6276271",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student a",
        "speaker": "Student A",
        "sourceStart": 1646,
        "sourceEnd": 1717,
        "text": "Can we say 'Although uniforms are cheap, some families still struggle'?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "66b811fa247d15eb89e78ff43f50fd931e8555b02b13153d8988d2fd242736b5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 1727,
        "sourceEnd": 1908,
        "text": "Yes, that's correct. Now, let's practice writing a paragraph. Your topic sentence could be: 'School uniforms have both advantages and disadvantages.' Then give supporting sentences.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "facdc63041c17d8a8c23bfa97a21252f6470a7f5292f1d4ad8e20f96a4d25332",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student b",
        "speaker": "Student B",
        "sourceStart": 1921,
        "sourceEnd": 1966,
        "text": "I think I understand now. Thank you, teacher.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b696ea1f763fa2c87c50996ec7b3dfb9b6e6ffea4ae2d7729ff5aa428554f4c8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "teacher",
        "speaker": "Teacher",
        "sourceStart": 1976,
        "sourceEnd": 2041,
        "text": "You're welcome. Remember to use these structures in your writing.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "62f04273cd814496e4095c44b1d90a04a5147b615e44f78faa14196bc3057ff3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
